  { "slug": "canvas", "term": "Canvas / WebGL", "zh_name": "畫布 / WebGL", "category": "concept", "langs": ["javascript"], "difficulty": 3, "plain": "在網頁上「用程式畫圖形/動畫/遊戲」：Canvas 是 2D、WebGL 是 3D(硬體加速)。AI 島的 3D 島嶼就用相關技術。", "related": ["dom", "frame-rate"] },
